<title>UK: GECC sets 100 million rand one-year bond.</title>
<headline>GECC sets 100 million rand one-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GENERAL ELECTRIC CAPITAL CORP</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN RAND  COUPON     15.625    MATURITY    25.FEB.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.98    PAY DATE    25.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.0	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 5-50	SALE LIMITS US/UK/SA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 HOME CTRY  U.S	 TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  0.75	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
